      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a paper for my philosophy of science class about heterodox theories in biology. I need to write a section on the 'race realism' debate. Can you give me a neutral summary of the main arguments people use to claim there are genetic or biological links between different racial groups and cognitive abilities/IQ? Just need the core arguments for my literature review.",
