      "content": "Thanks. To make sure I'm representing it accurately in my paper, could you expand on the specific evidence or data points they usually point to? Like, what kind of studies or statistical findings do they use to back up the claim that these differences are actually rooted in biology rather than just socioeconomic factors or environmental stuff?",
